    <string name="settings_privacy_policy_body">GalaxyFirm stores your device list and scan history only on this device; it sends only the model number and region code you enter to Samsung\'s firmware servers (fota-cloud-dn.ospserver.net and neofussvr.sslcs.cdngc.net); no account, analytics, ads or tracking; backups are files you create yourself.</string>
